      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#FFBE6F",
        "width": 592,
        "height": 960,
        "content": "## Multi-Angle Article-to-Carousel Publisher\n\nWatches a TechCrunch RSS feed for new articles. An AI agent identifies \n3 distinct content angles (different audiences), and each angle is \nturned into its own carousel and scheduled as a draft on both LinkedIn \nand Instagram. Sends a confirmation or failure email per angle.\n\n### How it works\n1. **RSS Feed Trigger** polls TechCrunch for new articles.\n2. **AI Agent** (Gemini) analyzes the article and returns 3 angles, \n   each with an audience, angle description, and hook.\n3. **Split Out** turns the 3 angles into separate items.\n4. **PostNitro AI** generates a carousel design per angle, using the \n   article URL.\n5. Each angle branches into two parallel drafts:\n   - ✅ **LinkedIn** draft (document post)\n   - ✅ **Instagram** draft (carousel post)\n6. **Merge** syncs both platform results per angle.\n7. ✅ Success → one email per angle confirming both drafts.\n8. ❌ Failure → error emailed with the article link and angle attempted.\n\n### Setup\n☐ Connect **PostNitro Embed** account (templateId, brandId, presetId)\n☐ Connect **Google Gemini** account (API key from aistudio.google.com)\n☐ Connect **Gmail** account\n☐ Confirm LinkedIn and Instagram account IDs in both scheduled-post nodes\n☐ Confirm the RSS feed URL (currently TechCrunch)\n\n### Customization\n- Swap `feedUrl` to monitor a different source\n- Change poll frequency (currently every minute)\n- Adjust `scheduledAt` offset (currently +1 day)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
